# white — white, black and greys (light), from omarchy's white theme.
#
# Upstream: https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy  themes/white/colors.toml  (df3d01c)
# Licence:  MIT, Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson
#
# Colours only; omarchy's wallpapers and images are not used. The mapping onto
# Ergon's 22 roles is ours, the same for every omarchy palette: BG0 background,
# BG1/BG2 the raised surfaces (lighter_background and selection; the darker
# step for a light ground), FG0 bright_foreground, FG1 foreground, DIM
# light_foreground, DIMMER dark_foreground, the ramp cyan/blue/magenta/yellow/
# red, HOT_* and BLUSH their bright_ forms, ACCENT blue, ACTIVE omarchy's accent.
# DIM is omarchy's muted grey: its light_foreground is black, and dark_foreground is #C0C0C0 (1.8:1).

COOL_BG0=#FFFFFF
COOL_BG1=#F5F5F5
COOL_BG2=#C0C0C0
COOL_FG0=#000000
COOL_FG1=#000000
COOL_DIM=#808080
COOL_DIMMER=#C0C0C0
COOL_0=#3E3E3E
COOL_1=#1A1A1A
COOL_2=#2E2E2E
COOL_3=#4A4A4A
COOL_4=#2A2A2A
COOL_HOT_0=#3E3E3E
COOL_HOT_4=#2A2A2A
COOL_MINT=#3A3A3A
COOL_BLUSH=#2E2E2E
COOL_ACCENT=#1A1A1A
COOL_ACTIVE=#6E6E6E
COOL_URGENT=#2A2A2A
COOL_WARN=#4A4A4A
COOL_GOOD=#3A3A3A
COOL_INACTIVE=#C0C0C0
